set system host-name junos-interface-policer
set firewall policer ARP-POLICER then discard
set firewall policer INPUT4-POLICER then discard
set firewall policer OUTPUT4-POLICER then discard
set firewall policer INPUT6-POLICER then discard
set interfaces ae0 unit 0 family inet policer arp ARP-POLICER
set interfaces ae0 unit 0 family inet policer input INPUT4-POLICER
set interfaces ae0 unit 0 family inet policer output OUTPUT4-POLICER
set interfaces ae0 unit 0 family inet6 policer input INPUT6-POLICER
set interfaces ae0 unit 0 family inet6 policer output OUTPUT6-MISSING
